msgstr "Proses terakhir melaporkan masalah. Lihat 'cachy-auto-update log'."

msgid "The last run was stopped before it finished."
msgstr "Proses terakhir dihentikan sebelum selesai."

msgid "The last run was cancelled. It will run again later."
msgstr "Proses terakhir dibatalkan. Akan berjalan lagi nanti."

msgid "A restart is recommended to finish a kernel update."
msgstr "Disarankan memulai ulang untuk menyelesaikan pembaruan kernel."

